1
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:01,800
<i>On my engagement day…</i>

2
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,040
<i>…all the police in Phuket</i>

3
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:06,640
<i>will be here to provide security</i>
<i>for the influential figures.</i>

4
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:10,360
I don't approve of this engagement.

5
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:12,800
<i>I love you, Rajit.</i>

6
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:17,240
Is it that dangerous, Uncle Ree?

7
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:19,240
What you're planning to do today?

8
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:21,680
Do you really think
Thatri would be stupid enough

9
00:02:21,760 --> 00:02:23,440
to throw his life away here,

10
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:25,360
just to save a worthless trash like him?

11
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:27,000
<i>Thatri will show up.</i>

12
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,360
Wai, run!

13
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:33,880
Wai!

14
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,120
Hurry. Let's go.

15
00:03:58,600 --> 00:03:59,600
Where did he go?

16
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,160
Split up and find him.

17
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:08,800
Hey!

18
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,280
-Hey!
-He's here!

19
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,600
Wai is safe. I'm not holding back.

20
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:38,080
Watch out!

21
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:42,920
He has bombs too?

22
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,560
-I'm out of here.
-Hey. Where are you going?

23
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,320
You damn coward.

24
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,640
Wai.

25
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:26,840
Trying to run away, huh?

26
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,480
Running from me?

27
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,600
Acting tough, huh?

28
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:03,440
Take this.

29
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,560
Vijarn!

30
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,280
We need to run now!

31
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,800
What happened?

32
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:23,240
Thatri has bombs.

33
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:26,600
Where did he get them from?
Where are my men?

34
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,920
They are all dead.

35
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:31,040
If he catches up to us, we won't survive.

36
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,880
-Hold on.
-Hey, stop it!

37
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:36,880
-No, sir!
-He has bombs!

38
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:39,360
Do you want to die? Just drop it.

39
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:41,480
Let go of me!

40
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:43,840
We are all going to get killed here.

41
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,760
Move!

42
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:19,520
Will you trade lives with me, Thatri?

43
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,000
Freeze!

44
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:32,440
Don't move!

45
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,440
Drop your weapons!

46
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,280
District Chief.

47
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,640
How could I let you fight this alone?

48
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,200
Just kill me already.

49
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,200
What are you waiting for?

50
00:08:58,400 --> 00:09:02,400
When you murdered those people,
did you ever feel any remorse?

51
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:05,880
If I cared about that,

52
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:08,600
why would I become a pirate?

53
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:13,960
What about when you helped
Mr. Vijarn traffic those drugs?

54
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:15,200
Do you regret that?

55
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:21,920
Why are you quiet?

56
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,080
Too cowardly to respond?

57
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:24,320
Stop talking.

58
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,600
Just kill me.

59
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,360
As you wish.

60
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:50,320
Doctor, are you back?

61
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:55,680
DOCTOR SOMSAK

62
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,120
Jiam. Nid.

63
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,200
Miss Rajit.

64
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:06,520
Jiam, is something wrong?

65
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:11,800
Wai was attacked?

66
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:14,840
-Who did this?
-I don't know.

67
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:17,880
Mr. Thatri sent someone
to inform us at dawn

68
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:20,640
that Wai was brutally attacked
and is in critical condition.

69
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:23,680
I was going to send Nid
to tell his mother,

70
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:25,400
but we had to come here first.

71
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:29,760
We were worried about you
since you fled days ago.

72
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:36,440
I'm sorry

73
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:39,840
-for causing trouble.
-It's alright.

74
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:41,240
If Mr. Thatri hadn't told us,

75
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:43,640
we wouldn't have known you were here.

76
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:49,840
Mr. Thatri told me before

77
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:52,360
that Wai went undercover

78
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:55,000
to take down Ms. Fuangfah
and Zhang Gong Cheng.

79
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:57,760
I wonder if they did this out of revenge.

80
00:10:58,640 --> 00:11:01,320
And how is Uncle Ree?
Did he get caught up in this too?

81
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:03,400
He should be fine.

82
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:07,080
If anything had happened to him,
the messenger would have told us.

83
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:09,320
But we can't help but worry.

84
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:11,920
If this is really
Zhang Gong Cheng's doing,

85
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:14,440
he might target
Mr. Thatri next for revenge.

86
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:26,920
THALANG HOSPITAL

87
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:32,880
By the time I found Wai,
he was already brutally beaten.

88
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:35,160
This shouldn't have happened.

89
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,920
At least Wai is still alive.

90
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,480
If you hadn't gone after him,

91
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:45,680
or intended to help from the start,

92
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:47,520
he might be dead by now.

93
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:53,000
Thank you, District Chief.

94
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:59,120
Did you see the faces
of Mr. Vijarn and Mr. Sathit?

95
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,960
I want you to be the witness.

96
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:05,440
Not at all. The gunfire
was completely chaotic.

97
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:09,440
If we go to court,

98
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:12,160
I won't be able to confirm
their identities.

99
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:14,400
It might not be enough
to convict Mr. Vijarn.

100
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:21,320
Then we have to put our hopes on Wai.

101
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:27,760
He is the only one who can testify for us.

102
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:43,800
It's all because of you!

103
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:46,600
If you had let me beat Wai to death,

104
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:48,720
we wouldn't be in this mess right now.

105
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,800
How can you blame me?

106
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:53,000
Everyone was just trying
to survive back then.

107
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:54,040
It was a bomb!

108
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:56,280
One or two more hits
and he would have been dead.

109
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:58,360
But weren't you the one who insisted

110
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:59,600
on using him as bait?

111
00:12:59,680 --> 00:13:01,040
Now that the plan backfired,

112
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:02,440
how can you blame me?

113
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,760
Splitting up now

114
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:17,840
will only make things worse.

115
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:20,200
Let's work together
and figure out our next move.

116
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:28,240
Now.

117
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:31,200
Zhang Gong Cheng
and the others are all dead.

118
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,960
Most of the witnesses are gone.

119
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:37,040
Only Wai is left.

120
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:40,760
There is only one way out.

121
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:43,600
Send someone to eliminate him
at the hospital.

122
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:46,600
But that's highly risky.

123
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:50,520
Nothing is riskier
than our current situation.

124
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:24,160
Excuse me.

125
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:28,480
Is this Wai's room?

126
00:15:28,560 --> 00:15:29,480
Yes, it is.

127
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,800
May I go inside to visit him?

128
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:34,520
Strict orders. No visitors allowed.

129
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:37,240
Wai used to work at my house,

130
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:38,840
and we lived under the same roof.

131
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:42,880
It's only natural
to visit him when he's sick.

132
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:45,440
Since I've brought this gift basket,

133
00:15:45,520 --> 00:15:46,920
please just let me in.

134
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:47,960
It's an order.

135
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:49,720
I can't let you in.

136
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:56,640
In that case, how is he doing now?

137
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:59,040
Is he strong enough
to testify to the police

138
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:00,960
about who attacked him?

139
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:04,400
I didn't know you cared so much
about finding the culprit, Mr. Vijarn.

140
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:06,360
What's the plan?

141
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:08,440
Are you going to drag them
to prison yourself?

142
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:13,360
What happened to your face?

143
00:16:15,640 --> 00:16:17,080
You really show up everywhere.

144
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:18,840
What is wrong with our legal system

145
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:22,080
that frauds and scammers like you
are allowed to walk free?

146
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:25,960
It's probably no different
from letting vile drug dealers

147
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:28,040
live honorable lives in this society.

148
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:29,880
Who are you calling a drug dealer?

149
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:32,000
Without proof, you'd better
shut your mouth.

150
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:35,040
I wasn't talking about you.
Did I mention your name?

151
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,360
There are plenty of evil people.

152
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:40,200
I was just speaking in general.

153
00:16:40,280 --> 00:16:43,000
One of those evil people is you.

154
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:44,720
You kidnapped Miss Rajit.

155
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:47,880
She's in a safe place.

156
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,560
And it wasn't a kidnapping,

157
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:51,360
it was a rescue.

158
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:54,120
If you think it's illegal,
go ahead and report it to the police.

159
00:16:58,400 --> 00:16:59,440
I forgot.

160
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:02,040
You are nothing to Rajit.

161
00:17:02,120 --> 00:17:03,960
You have no right to file a complaint.

162
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:14,560
Pass along my regards to him then.

163
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:16,240
Today is ruined.

164
00:17:18,079 --> 00:17:19,280
I've run into a jinx.

165
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:41,360
Auntie…

166
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,160
Going into the post office?

167
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:50,880
Why is she visiting so often?

168
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:01,320
What are you looking at?

169
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:04,560
Oh, nothing.

170
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:06,760
District Chief,

171
00:18:06,840 --> 00:18:09,040
Mr. Vijarn was just here
scouting the area.

172
00:18:09,120 --> 00:18:11,160
He's definitely planning to silence Wai.

173
00:18:13,800 --> 00:18:15,200
Just as we expected.

174
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:17,840
But our security is tight.

175
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:19,960
He won't be able to get to Wai.

176
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:22,440
Right.

177
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:26,800
Let him waste his time
trying to deal with Wai.

178
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:28,520
It works perfectly.

179
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:53,320
-Is this the place?
-Yes.

180
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:57,200
The superintendent sent officers
to set up a tight guard,

181
00:18:58,600 --> 00:19:00,800
specifically to protect our key witness.

182
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:28,640
How are you doing, Zhang Gong Cheng?

183
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:32,240
Are you here to mock me?

184
00:19:34,280 --> 00:19:35,480
No.

185
00:19:35,560 --> 00:19:37,440
Then just kill me already.

186
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:42,480
If I wanted you dead,

187
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:47,920
by letting you go, Mr. Vijarn
would have you hunted down,

188
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:50,560
just like what Fuang did to you.

189
00:19:55,800 --> 00:19:59,080
And you know exactly
why I spared your life, don't you?

190
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:04,560
Stop talking.

191
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:06,480
Just kill me.

192
00:20:07,360 --> 00:20:09,280
As you wish.

193
00:20:21,040 --> 00:20:22,200
Why'd you do that?

194
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:31,640
Wai is currently
the only remaining witness.

195
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:34,760
It won't be long

196
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:37,560
before Vijarn goes after him,

197
00:20:38,520 --> 00:20:39,920
since he's unconscious.

198
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:45,760
What does that have to do with me?

199
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:51,200
Because you are the other witness
Mr. Vijarn doesn't know is still alive.

200
00:20:54,280 --> 00:20:57,920
Cooperate with me, and you'll be safe.

201
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:02,440
I will never cooperate with you.

202
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:18,200
She's staying at the doctor's for while,

203
00:21:18,280 --> 00:21:20,920
yet she's ordering so many things.

204
00:21:21,560 --> 00:21:22,960
Treating me like her servant.

205
00:21:30,360 --> 00:21:32,080
-Is it beautiful, dear?
-Yes, it is.

206
00:21:32,160 --> 00:21:33,720
-Do you like them?
-Yes, I do.

207
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:36,520
Here you go.

208
00:21:37,120 --> 00:21:39,040
-Thank you.
-Alright.

209
00:21:39,120 --> 00:21:40,160
Let's go, dear.

210
00:21:41,560 --> 00:21:42,840
Let's go.

211
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:51,160
What's this?

212
00:21:51,840 --> 00:21:53,080
It's gypsophila.

213
00:21:54,560 --> 00:21:56,160
Gypsophila?

214
00:21:57,240 --> 00:21:59,080
It symbolizes an innocent heart

215
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:01,640
and a long-lasting, eternal love.

216
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:09,920
Then, I'll take a bouquet.

217
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:11,000
Sure.

218
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:14,920
-Here you go.
-Thank you.

219
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:29,200
Watch where you're going.

220
00:22:33,520 --> 00:22:34,600
Auntie?

221
00:22:40,760 --> 00:22:42,440
Visiting the post this frequently,

222
00:22:42,520 --> 00:22:44,160
something must be going on.

223
00:22:50,920 --> 00:22:52,320
Telegram delivery.

224
00:22:52,400 --> 00:22:53,400
DISTRICT CHIEF'S RESIDENCE

225
00:22:54,960 --> 00:22:56,320
Yes.

226
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:09,000
Thank you.

227
00:23:26,320 --> 00:23:27,680
<i>The war is over.</i>

228
00:23:27,760 --> 00:23:29,920
<i>I hope to hear good news regarding Sasi.</i>

229
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:33,280
<i>Don't worry I'll mind her being married.</i>

230
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:36,760
<i>I assure you I'll take good care of her.</i>

231
00:23:36,840 --> 00:23:38,760
<i>But if you cannot fulfill this,</i>

232
00:23:38,840 --> 00:23:41,440
<i>pay back your debt immediately.</i>

233
00:23:41,520 --> 00:23:43,440
<i>Lieutenant General Hemaraj Thanont.</i>

234
00:23:56,520 --> 00:23:58,960
Oh no, I can't leave it
lying around like that.

235
00:23:59,040 --> 00:24:01,040
Someone might see it.

236
00:24:04,760 --> 00:24:06,480
Oh. Tri.

237
00:24:07,160 --> 00:24:08,040
What are you doing?

238
00:24:09,760 --> 00:24:11,040
Tying my shoelaces.

239
00:24:19,080 --> 00:24:20,560
Did you need something from me?

240
00:24:21,160 --> 00:24:22,840
No. I just called out for no reason.

241
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:25,600
I didn't know you cared about me lately,

242
00:24:25,680 --> 00:24:27,280
always calling out when you see me.

243
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:29,520
I only did it out of politeness.

244
00:24:30,240 --> 00:24:32,920
How polite. You shouted so loudly.

245
00:24:33,600 --> 00:24:35,520
Just like someone
who is highly suspicious.

246
00:24:35,600 --> 00:24:36,920
What suspicious?

247
00:24:37,680 --> 00:24:40,120
What's that piece of paper
you just shoved into your bag?

248
00:24:40,200 --> 00:24:41,880
Mind your own business.

249
00:25:07,840 --> 00:25:08,960
Sasi,

250
00:25:10,280 --> 00:25:11,880
the war is over,

251
00:25:11,960 --> 00:25:14,800
and Bundit's career isn't going anywhere.

252
00:25:14,880 --> 00:25:16,440
When are you moving to Bangkok?

253
00:25:19,800 --> 00:25:22,360
Leaving yourself to suffer
in the kitchen like this every day,

254
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:24,600
I truly cannot tolerate watching it.

255
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:32,040
The only reason you can't tolerate it

256
00:25:32,760 --> 00:25:35,480
is because you fear you'll fail
to sell me off to the general?

257
00:25:38,720 --> 00:25:39,960
What?

258
00:25:40,640 --> 00:25:44,000
What general? What on earth
are you talking about?

259
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:47,160
You really have no idea?

260
00:26:04,040 --> 00:26:05,120
Tri.

261
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:10,920
Sasi, I have something to tell you.

262
00:26:12,440 --> 00:26:15,480
I saw a telegram she left behind.

263
00:26:15,560 --> 00:26:17,080
What telegram?

264
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:19,520
You'll understand
once you read it yourself.

265
00:26:31,120 --> 00:26:33,080
Oh. Tri.

266
00:26:35,120 --> 00:26:36,720
She hid it inside her bag.

267
00:26:57,440 --> 00:26:59,880
LIEUTENANT GENERAL HEMARAJ THANONT

268
00:27:06,040 --> 00:27:07,120
Mother…

269
00:27:21,360 --> 00:27:22,720
Tri.

270
00:27:22,800 --> 00:27:24,840
He just won't stop
poking his nose into everything.

271
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:26,120
I'm so sick of him.

272
00:27:28,280 --> 00:27:29,800
You say that he is nosy,

273
00:27:29,880 --> 00:27:32,160
yet you are interfering with my life too.

274
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:34,040
Sasi.

275
00:27:34,120 --> 00:27:35,560
I was wondering

276
00:27:35,640 --> 00:27:38,680
why you kept forcing me to go to Bangkok.

277
00:27:40,560 --> 00:27:42,280
The truth is,

278
00:27:43,040 --> 00:27:45,160
you never wanted me to be a librarian.

279
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:48,680
You just wanted to sell me off
to someone else!

280
00:27:49,280 --> 00:27:50,840
No.

281
00:27:51,960 --> 00:27:54,560
I didn't, Sasi.

282
00:27:54,640 --> 00:27:56,840
How can you still lie to my face

283
00:27:56,920 --> 00:27:59,480
when the evidence is right in front of us?

284
00:28:00,840 --> 00:28:04,120
Mother. What on earth do you take me for?

285
00:28:04,200 --> 00:28:07,080
It's… Well…

286
00:28:07,920 --> 00:28:10,160
-It's just that…
-Mother.

287
00:28:15,360 --> 00:28:16,880
Just tell me the truth.

288
00:28:18,280 --> 00:28:20,280
You want me to go to Bangkok

289
00:28:21,480 --> 00:28:24,240
so you can force me to marry the general?

290
00:28:25,960 --> 00:28:28,080
I…

291
00:28:31,000 --> 00:28:32,240
I…

292
00:28:32,320 --> 00:28:35,240
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

293
00:28:36,480 --> 00:28:39,240
Regarding the debt,
please give me a little more time.

294
00:28:39,320 --> 00:28:41,480
I truly have no money right now.

295
00:28:41,560 --> 00:28:43,840
I've granted you extensions many times.

296
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:46,720
The war is over,

297
00:28:46,800 --> 00:28:48,480
and the economy has improved.

298
00:28:49,160 --> 00:28:51,960
It should be much easier for you

299
00:28:52,040 --> 00:28:54,680
to find the money to repay me, Gaysorn.

300
00:28:55,480 --> 00:28:57,280
But the cost of living is still high.

301
00:28:57,360 --> 00:28:59,760
-My expenses are overwhelming.
-So do I.

302
00:29:05,160 --> 00:29:07,400
I am deeply sorry.

303
00:29:08,000 --> 00:29:10,320
Please give me more time
to gather the money.

304
00:29:13,520 --> 00:29:14,920
Let do this.

305
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:17,680
I'll be blunt, Gaysorn.

306
00:29:17,760 --> 00:29:20,360
I know you have a daughter,

307
00:29:22,240 --> 00:29:23,680
and a beautiful one at that.

308
00:29:25,440 --> 00:29:27,280
And you know very well

309
00:29:28,240 --> 00:29:29,720
how much I love beautiful women.

310
00:29:33,040 --> 00:29:34,920
That is impossible.

311
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:37,000
My daughter is already married

312
00:29:37,080 --> 00:29:39,040
and living with her husband in Phuket.

313
00:29:39,120 --> 00:29:41,560
If you can bring your daughter to me,

314
00:29:41,640 --> 00:29:44,280
all your debts will be erased.

315
00:29:44,360 --> 00:29:47,200
Your house won't be foreclosed on,

316
00:29:47,280 --> 00:29:49,680
and you won't have to move in
with your son-in-law.

317
00:29:56,760 --> 00:29:59,520
I consider myself very generous

318
00:29:59,600 --> 00:30:00,920
for offering this chance.

319
00:30:03,080 --> 00:30:06,160
Think about it carefully.

320
00:30:08,600 --> 00:30:10,760
I never wanted it to be like this.

321
00:30:12,320 --> 00:30:16,280
I was forced into it.
I simply didn't know what else to do.

322
00:30:19,600 --> 00:30:20,960
All this time,

323
00:30:22,320 --> 00:30:25,000
have you ever actually loved me?

324
00:30:25,920 --> 00:30:29,080
Of course I do. I love you.
How could I not love you?

325
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:31,320
But less than you love yourself

326
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:34,320
and your social status, right?

327
00:31:20,280 --> 00:31:21,320
Hey.

328
00:31:21,960 --> 00:31:23,120
Hey, you.

329
00:31:31,520 --> 00:31:32,640
Don't worry.

330
00:31:37,240 --> 00:31:39,080
We'll get through this together.

331
00:31:43,240 --> 00:31:44,680
You don't have to be afraid.

332
00:31:46,040 --> 00:31:49,080
She has never truly loved me.

333
00:31:55,680 --> 00:31:56,920
Please don't cry.

334
00:31:58,400 --> 00:31:59,520
Listen to me.

335
00:32:01,720 --> 00:32:05,320
Every mother loves her child.

336
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:09,520
It's just that her reasons

337
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:12,160
happen to be deeply hurtful to us.

338
00:32:13,600 --> 00:32:17,400
How long am I supposed to tolerate this?

339
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:20,920
When will she finally love me,

340
00:32:21,000 --> 00:32:23,720
without her own selfish reasons?

341
00:32:29,680 --> 00:32:30,600
Don't cry.

342
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:33,440
It's alright.

343
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:40,760
Everything will be fine.

344
00:32:49,960 --> 00:32:51,520
Oh, Auntie.

345
00:32:55,520 --> 00:32:57,360
If you want to mock me, just say it.

346
00:32:57,440 --> 00:32:59,520
No need to pretend you just arrived.

347
00:33:00,560 --> 00:33:03,080
I saw you standing
outside the kitchen the entire time.

348
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:14,120
Could you teach me how to braid hair?

349
00:33:22,520 --> 00:33:23,960
To braid,

350
00:33:24,040 --> 00:33:26,640
you divide the hair into three strands.

351
00:33:26,720 --> 00:33:29,560
Take the side strands
and cross them over to the center,

352
00:33:30,160 --> 00:33:31,880
alternating each time.

353
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:34,720
Let me try.

354
00:33:52,800 --> 00:33:54,680
You know, these three strands

355
00:33:54,760 --> 00:33:56,520
are like the hearts of three people.

356
00:34:03,040 --> 00:34:05,240
One heart thinks one way,

357
00:34:06,080 --> 00:34:07,640
and another thinks differently.

358
00:34:09,280 --> 00:34:11,760
They're apart and shifting back and forth.

359
00:34:15,520 --> 00:34:18,120
But they can only align and come together

360
00:34:18,199 --> 00:34:21,080
once all three are bound as one.

361
00:34:25,719 --> 00:34:27,280
This exact point

362
00:34:27,360 --> 00:34:30,000
is what they call the turning point
for mutual understanding.

363
00:34:36,040 --> 00:34:38,520
Sasi hates me now.

364
00:34:42,480 --> 00:34:45,360
It's my fault
for being so reckless with money.

365
00:34:47,120 --> 00:34:48,840
You never wanted to ruin Sasi's life

366
00:34:49,560 --> 00:34:52,280
by making her the general's kept woman?

367
00:34:55,600 --> 00:34:58,360
Who would want to see
their own daughter end up like that?

368
00:34:59,880 --> 00:35:01,880
If my house wasn't
on the verge of being seized,

369
00:35:01,960 --> 00:35:06,040
I would never hand Sasi
over to anyone else.

370
00:35:09,160 --> 00:35:11,040
Then why don't you fix it right now

371
00:35:11,120 --> 00:35:12,760
while you still have the chance?

372
00:35:17,040 --> 00:35:18,760
I don't mean to lecture you,

373
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:23,200
but isn't the best thing
a mother can do for her child

374
00:35:23,880 --> 00:35:26,280
simply ensuring their ultimate happiness?

375
00:35:45,200 --> 00:35:47,360
DISTRICT CHIEF'S RESIDENCE

376
00:35:50,680 --> 00:35:52,560
-Did you find my mother?
-Not at all.

377
00:35:55,600 --> 00:35:57,920
-Please calm down first.
-I can't stay calm.

378
00:36:01,640 --> 00:36:02,600
What happened?

379
00:36:02,680 --> 00:36:04,360
She packed her bags and left the house.

380
00:36:04,440 --> 00:36:06,640
I went up to her room,
but she wasn't there.

381
00:36:06,720 --> 00:36:08,280
All her clothes are gone.

382
00:36:09,720 --> 00:36:11,360
We aren't in Bangkok,

383
00:36:11,440 --> 00:36:14,200
and it's already dark.
Where could she possibly go?

384
00:36:16,840 --> 00:36:19,120
In that case,
I think there is only one place.

385
00:36:20,720 --> 00:36:21,920
Where is it?

386
00:36:28,160 --> 00:36:30,160
The boat leaves in ten minutes.

387
00:36:45,040 --> 00:36:47,640
PHUKET PIER

388
00:36:47,720 --> 00:36:48,880
Mother.

389
00:36:49,680 --> 00:36:51,000
Mother.

390
00:36:51,080 --> 00:36:53,560
-What are you doing here?
-Sasi.

391
00:36:57,040 --> 00:36:58,960
Everything is my fault.

392
00:36:59,040 --> 00:37:01,600
I shouldn't have been
so terrified of foreclosure

393
00:37:02,280 --> 00:37:05,080
that I considered
giving you to the general.

394
00:37:08,160 --> 00:37:09,800
I'm sorry.

395
00:37:09,880 --> 00:37:12,920
I'm going back to fix everything myself.

396
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:14,600
Don't worry.

397
00:37:15,200 --> 00:37:16,920
I won't give you away ever again.

398
00:37:19,000 --> 00:37:20,400
Mother.

399
00:37:21,280 --> 00:37:23,600
When I return to Bangkok this time,

400
00:37:24,400 --> 00:37:27,240
I'll tell the general
to just take the house.

401
00:37:28,160 --> 00:37:31,880
We still have the government quarters
in Phuket anyway.

402
00:37:35,000 --> 00:37:36,840
There's no need for that.

403
00:37:40,600 --> 00:37:42,080
I'll apply for a loan

404
00:37:43,400 --> 00:37:45,800
to pay off your debt
to the general myself.

405
00:37:46,960 --> 00:37:50,560
As for this loan, I'll focus on working

406
00:37:51,800 --> 00:37:53,320
to help pay off the debt myself.

407
00:37:57,520 --> 00:37:58,960
Absolutely not.

408
00:37:59,040 --> 00:38:02,240
Staying here has already been
too much of a burden on you.

409
00:38:02,840 --> 00:38:05,160
Letting them seize the house is fine.

410
00:38:05,880 --> 00:38:09,240
But my father built that house.

411
00:38:09,760 --> 00:38:12,120
If it gets seized,

412
00:38:12,200 --> 00:38:14,640
it would completely break your heart.

413
00:38:22,080 --> 00:38:24,960
I know exactly
how it feels to lose a home.

414
00:38:25,800 --> 00:38:27,480
Please accept his help.

415
00:38:28,280 --> 00:38:31,840
I don't want you
to live with regrets like I do.

416
00:38:47,400 --> 00:38:49,840
Please, Mother.

417
00:39:00,520 --> 00:39:03,800
Thank you so much, Bundit.

418
00:39:06,640 --> 00:39:08,480
Of course, Mother.

419
00:39:25,320 --> 00:39:28,920
PHUKET PIER

420
00:39:41,800 --> 00:39:44,560
DOCTOR SOMSAK

421
00:39:52,200 --> 00:39:53,480
Uncle Ree,

422
00:39:53,560 --> 00:39:55,840
did you get everything I asked you to buy?

423
00:39:56,880 --> 00:39:57,720
Yes, all of it.

424
00:40:03,480 --> 00:40:05,640
And what were you just smiling about?

425
00:40:07,320 --> 00:40:08,760
I did a good deed,

426
00:40:08,840 --> 00:40:10,120
so, of course, I'm smiling.

427
00:40:11,120 --> 00:40:13,520
A good deed? What kind of good deed?

428
00:40:13,600 --> 00:40:15,440
You can barely handle your own mess.

429
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:19,120
I helped a mother and daughter reconcile.

430
00:40:21,200 --> 00:40:23,880
Do you mean Ms. Gaysorn and Ms. Sasitorn?

431
00:40:24,920 --> 00:40:25,840
Yes.

432
00:40:25,920 --> 00:40:28,480
At first, I worried
I might make things worse,

433
00:40:28,560 --> 00:40:30,600
but they eventually made up.

434
00:40:30,680 --> 00:40:33,160
The problem is solved,
so I can rest easy now.

435
00:40:33,240 --> 00:40:34,800
I see.

436
00:40:34,880 --> 00:40:37,000
You're good at solving
other people's problems.

437
00:40:53,240 --> 00:40:55,640
I was worried it would wither
before reaching you,

438
00:40:56,400 --> 00:40:59,160
but these flowers
are tougher than I thought.

439
00:41:10,040 --> 00:41:11,240
Thank you.

440
00:41:22,200 --> 00:41:24,000
Come here. Let me style your hair.

441
00:41:27,040 --> 00:41:28,160
Style my hair?

442
00:42:06,840 --> 00:42:08,520
Do you know how to braid hair?

443
00:42:09,120 --> 00:42:10,360
I practiced.

444
00:42:11,240 --> 00:42:13,320
It will definitely look beautiful.

445
00:42:24,160 --> 00:42:25,880
What are you doing?

446
00:42:48,120 --> 00:42:50,760
The moment the florist
told me the meaning of gypsophila,

447
00:42:50,840 --> 00:42:52,760
I instantly thought of you.

448
00:42:55,680 --> 00:42:57,280
What does it mean?

449
00:42:58,440 --> 00:42:59,960
An innocent heart.

450
00:43:02,240 --> 00:43:05,920
Are you calling me innocent?

451
00:43:06,000 --> 00:43:07,520
I'm already grown up.

452
00:43:09,840 --> 00:43:11,680
That's not the only meaning.

453
00:43:13,880 --> 00:43:16,640
Then what else is it?

454
00:43:19,200 --> 00:43:20,760
Gypsophila?

455
00:43:21,360 --> 00:43:23,120
It symbolizes an innocent heart

456
00:43:23,200 --> 00:43:25,680
and a long-lasting, eternal love.

457
00:43:32,520 --> 00:43:33,680
It's a secret.

458
00:43:33,760 --> 00:43:35,800
Oh, come on.

459
00:43:35,880 --> 00:43:37,880
You can't leave me hanging like this.

460
00:43:41,840 --> 00:43:43,440
The doctor isn't around,

461
00:43:43,520 --> 00:43:45,320
so I am staying here tonight.

462
00:43:45,400 --> 00:43:48,200
Mr. Vijarn has been
searching for you relentlessly.

463
00:43:48,280 --> 00:43:51,560
I'll stay by your side
until I'm certain he has given up.

464
00:43:52,760 --> 00:43:54,200
Do you actually care about me?

465
00:43:54,280 --> 00:43:56,400
Usually, you worry about everyone else,

466
00:43:56,480 --> 00:43:58,240
except for me.

467
00:44:00,640 --> 00:44:01,720
Of course I do.

468
00:44:02,760 --> 00:44:04,040
I care about you,

469
00:44:04,640 --> 00:44:07,840
and I'll never let anyone
take away my only fortune.

470
00:44:10,440 --> 00:44:11,880
Fortune?

471
00:44:12,640 --> 00:44:15,040
Wait, don't tell me

472
00:44:15,120 --> 00:44:17,240
you are planning to scam my house again?

473
00:44:18,040 --> 00:44:19,120
I'm not.

474
00:44:20,160 --> 00:44:22,160
Then what is this fortune?

475
00:44:28,880 --> 00:44:31,800
-It's a secret.
-Tell me right now.

476
00:44:32,400 --> 00:44:35,240
You always make me feel so suspicious.

477
00:44:35,320 --> 00:44:36,560
I won't tell.

478
00:44:37,480 --> 00:44:40,120
Please? Just tell me a little bit.

479
00:44:40,800 --> 00:44:41,680
I won't tell.

480
00:44:42,920 --> 00:44:44,520
Fine, I don't care.

481
00:45:27,320 --> 00:45:28,720
It's late. Why are you awake?

482
00:45:28,800 --> 00:45:30,400
Are you afraid I might do something?

483
00:45:35,040 --> 00:45:36,400
I'm not afraid of that.

484
00:45:37,080 --> 00:45:38,760
I trust you.

485
00:45:39,560 --> 00:45:41,280
Then why are you still awake?

486
00:45:42,280 --> 00:45:44,360
I haven't done much since coming here,

487
00:45:45,040 --> 00:45:47,320
so I don't feel exhausted or drowsy.

488
00:45:47,920 --> 00:45:50,800
I'm not tired or sleepy.

489
00:45:52,160 --> 00:45:53,720
Maybe it's the new environment.

490
00:46:04,320 --> 00:46:05,720
To fall asleep,

491
00:46:07,080 --> 00:46:08,400
you need to count sheep.

492
00:46:09,600 --> 00:46:12,600
One sheep… Two sheep…

493
00:46:14,560 --> 00:46:18,000
I've tried that before.
It doesn't help at all.

494
00:46:23,080 --> 00:46:24,840
Then I'll change the method.

495
00:46:25,680 --> 00:46:29,040
How about one Thatri…

496
00:46:29,880 --> 00:46:31,160
Two Thatri…

497
00:46:35,000 --> 00:46:35,960
Are you

498
00:46:36,040 --> 00:46:38,880
trying to sneak into my dreams?

499
00:46:40,280 --> 00:46:41,400
Is that possible?

500
00:46:50,880 --> 00:46:52,320
Then I'll start counting.

501
00:46:57,160 --> 00:46:58,560
One Thatri…

502
00:47:01,040 --> 00:47:02,520
Two Thatri…

503
00:47:03,960 --> 00:47:05,600
Three Thatri…

504
00:47:42,920 --> 00:47:44,960
Ninety-seven Thatri…

505
00:47:47,440 --> 00:47:49,400
Ninety-eight Thatri…

506
00:47:50,760 --> 00:47:52,880
Ninety-nine Thatri…

507
00:47:55,960 --> 00:47:58,080
One hundred Thatri…

508
00:48:05,920 --> 00:48:06,960
Rajit.

509
00:48:39,720 --> 00:48:42,240
Good night. Sleep well

510
00:49:16,880 --> 00:49:18,400
One Rajit…

511
00:49:20,720 --> 00:49:22,160
Two Rajit…

512
00:49:24,560 --> 00:49:26,320
Three Rajit…

513
00:49:28,480 --> 00:49:30,320
Four Rajit…

514
00:49:32,880 --> 00:49:34,720
Five Rajit…

515
00:50:28,520 --> 00:50:31,480
Vijarn, you can't sit in Uncle Som's seat.

516
00:50:31,560 --> 00:50:33,400
Why not?

517
00:50:33,480 --> 00:50:35,760
Since Miss Rajit has disappeared,

518
00:50:35,840 --> 00:50:37,840
I must step in to help

519
00:50:37,920 --> 00:50:39,960
as her future husband.

520
00:50:43,520 --> 00:50:45,520
Showing your true colors already.

521
00:50:45,600 --> 00:50:49,680
Rajit made the right call
by running away from the engagement.

522
00:50:51,680 --> 00:50:52,760
Unless I hear it

523
00:50:52,840 --> 00:50:56,120
directly from Miss Rajit,
I won't accept it.

524
00:50:56,200 --> 00:50:57,360
Everyone saw

525
00:50:57,440 --> 00:50:59,840
that Mr. Thatri kidnapped her.

526
00:51:02,120 --> 00:51:04,600
Delude yourself all you want,

527
00:51:05,280 --> 00:51:06,920
but I will be the one

528
00:51:07,640 --> 00:51:10,720
taking over Miss Rajit's duties for now.

529
00:51:13,960 --> 00:51:15,400
Listen, Ms. Paetai.

530
00:51:16,320 --> 00:51:18,200
According to the will,

531
00:51:18,280 --> 00:51:19,640
none of the property

532
00:51:19,720 --> 00:51:22,680
ever belonged to you.

533
00:51:24,080 --> 00:51:25,760
Why bother?

534
00:51:27,560 --> 00:51:30,080
I'm truly worried about Miss Rajit.

535
00:51:30,600 --> 00:51:33,640
The real Thatri
hasn't claimed the inheritance yet,

536
00:51:34,320 --> 00:51:38,560
and I'm transferring everything
to Miss Rajit's name.

537
00:51:38,640 --> 00:51:41,160
Someone else is bound to try and steal it.

538
00:51:43,600 --> 00:51:45,280
Did Uncle Som leave

539
00:51:45,360 --> 00:51:49,080
any assets to you in the will?

540
00:51:49,160 --> 00:51:52,360
Is that why you're meddling
and worrying about others stealing it?

541
00:51:52,440 --> 00:51:54,760
You're acting as if you expect
to keep it for yourself.

542
00:51:56,160 --> 00:51:58,440
Once I marry Miss Rajit,

543
00:51:58,520 --> 00:52:00,240
I'll naturally be the one managing it.

544
00:52:01,760 --> 00:52:04,080
Until we hear it from Miss Rajit,

545
00:52:04,160 --> 00:52:05,640
do not dare to do anything.

546
00:52:05,720 --> 00:52:08,840
She has never rushed to claim the wealth.

547
00:52:14,360 --> 00:52:16,760
I will hold onto her work

548
00:52:16,840 --> 00:52:18,640
until she returns.

549
00:52:19,360 --> 00:52:21,000
-Nid.
-Yes.

550
00:52:26,600 --> 00:52:28,160
This chair belongs to Mr. Som.

551
00:52:28,240 --> 00:52:30,960
It is reserved exclusively for Miss Rajit.

552
00:52:31,040 --> 00:52:32,720
Please stand up.

553
00:52:38,160 --> 00:52:39,800
I said stand up!

554
00:53:10,240 --> 00:53:12,520
EMERGENCY ROOM

555
00:53:12,600 --> 00:53:14,040
Alright.

556
00:53:17,480 --> 00:53:20,240
-Oh, Mr. Thatri.
-Nid. Jiam.

557
00:53:20,320 --> 00:53:23,120
Here are the files that Rajit wanted.

558
00:53:23,800 --> 00:53:24,680
Thank you.

559
00:53:26,040 --> 00:53:27,880
Having this will definitely keep her busy.

560
00:53:30,040 --> 00:53:31,160
Did you just visit Wai?

561
00:53:31,240 --> 00:53:35,040
Yes, but the police wouldn't let us in,
so we just left the packages for him.

562
00:53:37,440 --> 00:53:40,440
Please bring Miss Rajit back quickly.
Mr. Vijarn is crossing the line.

563
00:53:40,520 --> 00:53:42,640
He's trying to take over
all of her duties.

564
00:53:42,720 --> 00:53:43,600
Exactly.

565
00:53:43,680 --> 00:53:46,680
He's rushing the transfer
of all Mr. Som's assets

566
00:53:46,760 --> 00:53:48,600
into Miss Rajit's name.

567
00:53:53,760 --> 00:53:55,840
It looks like I need to bring
that Wild Bull back.

568
00:54:05,720 --> 00:54:06,600
You must be crazy.

569
00:54:06,680 --> 00:54:08,680
You don't like living comfortably.

570
00:54:10,120 --> 00:54:11,600
My life is always full of drama.

571
00:54:11,680 --> 00:54:14,720
When nothing is happening,
I actually get bored.

572
00:54:16,120 --> 00:54:17,960
It's not just your life
that's full of drama.

573
00:54:18,040 --> 00:54:19,800
Mine is exactly the same.

574
00:54:21,080 --> 00:54:24,200
The person who brought me
into this hardship has to help me too.

575
00:54:31,880 --> 00:54:33,800
And why on earth should I help you?

576
00:54:35,240 --> 00:54:36,560
No complaining.

577
00:54:48,960 --> 00:54:51,440
Do you always wear that necklace?

578
00:54:56,800 --> 00:54:58,320
Aren't you wearing yours?

579
00:54:59,840 --> 00:55:04,520
Well… I've been a bit bored lately,
so I was too lazy to put it on.

580
00:55:06,720 --> 00:55:08,160
You get bored too easily.

581
00:55:09,520 --> 00:55:11,240
You don't even appreciate these things.

582
00:55:12,800 --> 00:55:14,240
Fine, I'm not bored anymore.

583
00:55:23,200 --> 00:55:25,280
I thought you said you weren't wearing it.

584
00:55:26,720 --> 00:55:28,120
I was just teasing.

585
00:55:28,200 --> 00:55:31,920
I wanted to see
what kind of face you'd make.

586
00:55:39,120 --> 00:55:40,320
So, what do you think?

587
00:55:43,960 --> 00:55:45,520
I feel relieved.

588
00:56:30,400 --> 00:56:31,840
Get to work.

589
00:56:35,120 --> 00:56:36,520
I know.

590
00:56:36,600 --> 00:56:39,280
I'll do it anyway, so don't worry.

591
00:56:39,360 --> 00:56:40,800
You have to work too.

592
00:57:04,440 --> 00:57:05,960
She falls asleep once she has work.

593
00:57:27,840 --> 00:57:28,960
Rajit.

594
00:57:30,800 --> 00:57:31,840
Rajit.

595
00:57:31,920 --> 00:57:33,560
Go to bed.

596
00:57:37,280 --> 00:57:38,440
Rajit.

597
00:57:41,320 --> 00:57:43,200
Just a moment…

598
00:58:07,280 --> 00:58:09,600
Auntie. Uncle Thatri.

599
00:58:09,680 --> 00:58:11,720
<i>It turns out the real Thatri</i>

600
00:58:11,800 --> 00:58:13,560
<i>is actually a friend of our Thatri.</i>

601
00:58:13,640 --> 00:58:15,880
Then, we must nip this
in the bud immediately.

602
00:58:15,960 --> 00:58:18,080
I've already taken care of it for you.

603
00:58:22,640 --> 00:58:24,040
<i>Are you trying to silence me?</i>

604
00:58:24,120 --> 00:58:25,280
Vijarn!

605
00:58:26,920 --> 00:58:29,440
I have nothing left to lose now!

606
00:58:30,120 --> 00:58:32,880
But at least I killed that old man
with my own hands.

607
00:58:32,960 --> 00:58:35,120
I finally got my revenge.

608
00:58:35,200 --> 00:58:37,240
You killed my Grandpa?!

609
00:58:37,320 --> 00:58:38,640
I killed him myself.

610
00:59:08,520 --> 00:59:10,720
Subtitle translation by:
Khathathong Thongtumlueng
